40
00:01:59.317 --> 00:02:18.373
In the race, Dara runs quickly, but the old turtle walks slowly. Malis carries the eggs carefully. In the library, we speak quietly. At the football match, fans shout loudly. Lina sings happily. Malis played badly last week, but now she can do the puzzle easily!

